OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a fairly cloudy day
OL,6,Fbut with some bright spells at times.
OL,7,FSome dry spells between a few
OL,8,Fscattered light showers. Brisk winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be quite cloudy
OL,11,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,12,Fa few scattered light showers, but
OL,13,Fstaying mostly dry with some clear
OL,14,Fspells in the southeast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA mostly dry start with
OL,17,Fvariable cloud and some bright spells.
OL,18,FClouding over from the west with some
OL,19,Fpatchy light rain in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
